---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Regions & Countries — Baseline Availability
description: Compare top-level Baseline Widely available, Newly available, and yearly Baseline availability across UN M49 regions, subregions, and countries.
skipDefaultDataBundles: true
---

{% set regionsModel = baseline_region_summary | buildRegionsTableModel(baseline_country_summary, baseline_summary) %}

{% if regionsModel and regionsModel.rows and regionsModel.rows.length > 0 %}
<baseline-regions-table id="baseline-regions-table" class="regions-page-shell">
  <section class="hero-section" aria-labelledby="page-main-heading">
    <h1 id="page-main-heading" class="sr-only">Regions and Countries Baseline Availability</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Compare top-level Baseline availability across UN M49 regions, subregions, and individual countries over the last {{ regionsModel.recentWindowDays }} days of Cloudflare BEACON RUM Archive traffic.
    </p>

    <div class="meta-pills" role="region" aria-label="Dataset summary">
      <span class="meta-pill">
        <strong>{{ regionsModel.recentWindowDays }}-day window:</strong>
        <code>{{ regionsModel.recentStartDate }}</code> <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="sr-only">to</span> <code>{{ regionsModel.recentEndDate }}</code>
      </span>
      <span class="meta-pill">
        <strong>Coverage:</strong>
        <span>{{ regionsModel.macroCount }} macro-regions &bull; {{ regionsModel.countryCount }} countries &amp; territories</span>
      </span>
      {% if baseline_summary and baseline_summary.avgMappedPercentage %}
      <span class="meta-pill">
        <strong>Global mapped traffic:</strong>
        <span>{{ baseline_summary.avgMappedPercentage | formatPct }}</span><a href="#footnote-mapped-traffic" id="footnote-ref-mapped-traffic" class="footnote-ref" aria-label="Footnote: Why some traffic is not mapped" title="Why some traffic is not mapped">*</a>
      </span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="regions-top-bar" role="region" aria-label="Table grouping and WebView controls">
      <div class="regions-control-group">
        <span id="regions-groupby-label" class="location-filter-label">
          <svg class="location-filter-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>View</span>
        </span>
        <div class="metric-toggle-group" role="group" aria-labelledby="regions-groupby-label">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="metric-toggle-btn"
            data-group-by-btn="region"
            aria-pressed="true"
            id="btn-group-by-region"
          >
            Group by region
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="metric-toggle-btn"
            data-group-by-btn="country"
            aria-pressed="false"
            id="btn-group-by-country"
          >
            Group by country
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="regions-control-group">
        <span id="regions-webview-label" class="location-filter-label">
          <svg class="location-filter-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line>
          </svg>
          <span>WebViews</span>
        </span>
        <div class="metric-toggle-group" role="group" aria-labelledby="regions-webview-label">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="metric-toggle-btn"
            data-webview-mode="include"
            aria-pressed="true"
            id="btn-regions-webview-include"
            aria-label="Include Android and iOS WebViews"
          >
            Include WebViews
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="metric-toggle-btn"
            data-webview-mode="exclude"
            aria-pressed="false"
            id="btn-regions-webview-exclude"
            aria-label="Exclude Android and iOS WebViews"
          >
            Exclude WebViews
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-copy-link-live-region></div>
  <div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-regions-live-region></div>

  <section id="regional-availability" class="status-card regions-card" aria-labelledby="regional-availability-heading">
    <div class="status-header regions-card-header">
      <div class="status-header-main">
        <h2 id="regional-availability-heading" class="status-heading-row">
          <span class="status-heading-title">Regions &amp; Countries Availability</span>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="section-link-btn"
            data-copy-section-link="regional-availability"
            data-section-title="Regions &amp; Countries Availability"
            aria-label="Copy link to Regions and Countries Availability section"
            title="Copy link to this section"
          >
            <svg class="section-link-icon section-link-icon-chain" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M6.75 9.25a3.18 3.18 0 0 0 4.5 0l2-2a3.18 3.18 0 0 0-4.5-4.5l-1.1 1.1"></path>
              <path d="M9.25 6.75a3.18 3.18 0 0 0-4.5 0l-2 2a3.18 3.18 0 0 0 4.5 4.5l1.1-1.1"></path>
            </svg>
            <svg class="section-link-icon section-link-icon-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="3.5 8.5 6.5 11.5 12.5 4.5"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span class="section-link-copied-badge" aria-hidden="true">Copied!</span>
          </button>
          <span class="scope-heading-badge" data-groupby-badge>Grouped by region</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle" data-regions-subtitle>
          Expand any region row to view subregions and countries within, or select any column header to sort (<span data-webview-subtitle-note>including WebViews</span>).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="regions-toolbar">
        <div class="regions-search-wrap">
          <label for="regions-search-input" class="sr-only">Filter regions or countries by name or ISO code</label>
          <svg class="regions-search-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="9" cy="9" r="6"></circle>
            <path d="m13.5 13.5 4 4"></path>
          </svg>
          <input
            type="search"
            id="regions-search-input"
            class="regions-search-input"
            data-regions-search
            placeholder="Filter regions or countries..."
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
          >
          <button
            type="button"
            class="regions-search-clear"
            data-regions-search-clear
            hidden
            aria-label="Clear filter"
            title="Clear filter"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="regions-tree-actions" data-tree-actions role="group" aria-label="Expand or collapse all regions">
          <button type="button" class="regions-tree-action-btn" data-expand-all-btn>Expand all</button>
          <button type="button" class="regions-tree-action-btn" data-collapse-all-btn>Collapse all</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <svg class="sr-only" width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <defs>
        <symbol id="icon-drilldown-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M5 11 11 5"></path>
          <path d="M6 5h5v5"></path>
        </symbol>
        <symbol id="icon-sort-chevron" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M6 2.25v7.5"></path>
          <path d="m3 6.75 3 3 3-3"></path>
        </symbol>
      </defs>
    </svg>

    <div class="table-wrapper regions-table-wrapper">
      <table class="data-table regions-table" id="regions-stats-table" data-group-mode="region">
        <caption class="sr-only" data-regions-caption>
          Last {{ regionsModel.recentWindowDays }} days average Baseline availability across UN M49 regions and countries
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="region-sticky-col region-header-name" aria-sort="ascending" data-sort-th="name">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="regions-sort-btn regions-sort-btn-name is-sorted"
                data-sort-btn="name"
                data-sort-dir="asc"
              >
                <span data-name-col-label>Region / Country</span>
                <span class="regions-sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg class="regions-sort-svg" width="11" height="11"><use href="#icon-sort-chevron"></use></svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </th>
            {%- for col in regionsModel.columns %}
            <th scope="col" class="num-col region-header-metric region-header-{{ col.kind }}" aria-sort="none" data-sort-th="{{ col.id }}">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="regions-sort-btn regions-sort-btn-num"
                data-sort-btn="{{ col.id }}"
                data-sort-dir="none"
                aria-label="Sort by {{ col.fullLabel }}"
                title="Sort by {{ col.fullLabel }}"
              >
                {%- if col.kind == "widely" %}
                <img src="/assets/img/baseline-widely-icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="12" aria-hidden="true" class="regions-th-logo">
                {%- elif col.kind == "newly" %}
                <img src="/assets/img/baseline-newly-icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="12" aria-hidden="true" class="regions-th-logo">
                {%- endif %}
                <span>{{ col.shortLabel }}</span>
                <span class="regions-sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg class="regions-sort-svg" width="11" height="11"><use href="#icon-sort-chevron"></use></svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </th>
            {%- endfor %}
          </tr>
        </thead>

        {% if regionsModel.globalRow %}
        <tbody class="regions-global-tbody" data-global-tbody>
          <tr
            class="region-table-row region-row-global"
            data-node-id="{{ regionsModel.globalRow.nodeId }}"
            data-has-data="{{ 'true' if regionsModel.globalRow.hasData else 'false' }}"
            data-has-nowv-data="{{ 'true' if regionsModel.globalRow.hasNoWvData else 'false' }}"
          >
            <th scope="row" class="region-sticky-col region-name-cell">
              <div class="region-cell-inner">
                <span class="region-leaf-identity">
                  <span class="opt-badge opt-badge-global">Global</span>
                  <span class="region-label-text">{{ regionsModel.globalRow.name }}</span>
                </span>
                <a
                  href="{{ regionsModel.globalRow.drilldownHref }}"
                  class="region-drilldown-link"
                  data-drilldown-link
                  aria-label="View detailed charts for Worldwide"
                  title="View detailed charts for Worldwide"
                >
                  <svg width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-drilldown-arrow"></use></svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </th>
            {%- for cell in regionsModel.globalRow.cells %}
            <td
              class="num-col region-metric-cell region-col-{{ cell.kind }}{% if cell.pct === null %} is-no-data{% endif %}"
              data-col="{{ cell.id }}"
              data-pct="{{ '' if cell.pct === null else cell.pct }}"
              data-pct-nowv="{{ '' if cell.pctNoWv === null else cell.pctNoWv }}"
              {%- if cell.kind == "traffic" %} data-static-display="true"{% endif %}
            >{% if cell.display %}{{ cell.display }}{% elif cell.pct === null %}&mdash;{% else %}{{ cell.pct | formatPct }}{% endif %}</td>
            {%- endfor %}
          </tr>
        </tbody>
        {% endif %}

        <tbody class="regions-body-tbody" data-regions-tbody>
          {%- for row in regionsModel.rows %}
          <tr
            class="region-table-row region-row-{{ row.rowKind }}{% if row.regionLevel %} region-level-{{ row.regionLevel }}{% endif %}{% if row.hasChildren %} is-expandable{% endif %}"
            data-node-id="{{ row.nodeId }}"
            data-parent-id="{{ row.parentId }}"
            data-row-kind="{{ row.rowKind }}"
            data-region-level="{{ row.regionLevel }}"
            data-tree-depth="{{ row.treeDepth }}"
            data-code="{{ row.code }}"
            data-name="{{ row.name }}"
            data-breadcrumb="{{ row.breadcrumb }}"
            data-has-children="{{ 'true' if row.hasChildren else 'false' }}"
            data-sort-last="{{ 'true' if row.sortLast else 'false' }}"
            data-has-data="{{ 'true' if row.hasData else 'false' }}"
            data-has-nowv-data="{{ 'true' if row.hasNoWvData else 'false' }}"
            {% if row.treeDepth > 0 %}hidden{% endif %}
          >
            <th scope="row" class="region-sticky-col region-name-cell">
              <div class="region-cell-inner">
                {%- if row.hasChildren %}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="region-expand-btn"
                  data-expand-btn
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-label="{{ row.name }} ({{ row.countryCount }} {% if row.countryCount == 1 %}country{% else %}countries{% endif %})"
                >
                  <span class="region-chevron-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="region-expand-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <path d="m6 3.5 4.5 4.5L6 12.5"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  <span class="region-label-text">{{ row.name }}</span>
                  <span class="region-child-badge" title="{{ row.countryCount }} {% if row.countryCount == 1 %}country{% else %}countries{% endif %}">{{ row.countryCount }}</span>
                </button>
                {%- else %}
                <span class="region-leaf-identity">
                  <span class="opt-badge opt-badge-country">{{ row.code }}</span>
                  <span class="region-label-text">{{ row.name }}</span>
                </span>
                {%- endif %}
                <a
                  href="{{ row.drilldownHref }}"
                  class="region-drilldown-link"
                  data-drilldown-link
                  aria-label="View detailed charts for {{ row.name }}"
                  title="View detailed charts for {{ row.name }}"
                >
                  <svg width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-drilldown-arrow"></use></svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </th>
            {%- for cell in row.cells %}
            <td
              class="num-col region-metric-cell region-col-{{ cell.kind }}{% if cell.pct === null %} is-no-data{% endif %}"
              data-col="{{ cell.id }}"
              data-pct="{{ '' if cell.pct === null else cell.pct }}"
              data-pct-nowv="{{ '' if cell.pctNoWv === null else cell.pctNoWv }}"
              {%- if cell.kind == "traffic" %} data-static-display="true"{% endif %}
            >{% if cell.display %}{{ cell.display }}{% elif cell.pct === null %}&mdash;{% else %}{{ cell.pct | formatPct }}{% endif %}</td>
            {%- endfor %}
          </tr>
          {%- endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="features-empty-state regions-empty-state" data-regions-empty hidden>
      <p class="features-empty-title">No regions or countries match your filter.</p>
      <button type="button" class="regions-tree-action-btn" data-regions-empty-reset>Clear filter</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "partials/mapped-traffic-footnote.njk" %}
</baseline-regions-table>
{% else %}
<section class="status-card">
  <p class="empty-state">
    No regional Baseline summary data generated yet. Run <code>npm run fetch-data</code> to query BigQuery and compute regional and country Baseline metrics.
  </p>
</section>
{% endif %}
